{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Bekaraar karke hame yoon na jaiye,
[F]Aapko [C]hamaari qasam, [Dm]laut aaiye,
[Dm]Dekhiye wo kaali kaali badaliyaan
[Gm]Julf ki ghata chura n le kahin
[Dm]Chori chori a ke shokh bijaliyaan
[Gm]Apaki ada chura n le kahin
[Dm]Yun kadam [F]akele n [Dm]age badhaaiye
[F]Aapko [C]hamaari qasam, [Dm]laut aaiye,
[Dm]Zindagi ke raaste ajeeb hai,
[Gm]In mey is tarah chalaa na kijiye,
[Dm]Khair hai isi me aapki huzoor,
[Gm]Apna koi saathi dhoond lijiye,
[Dm]Sunke dil [F]ki baat [Dm]yu na muskuraiye
[F]Aapko [C]hamaari qasam, [Dm]laut aaiye,
[D]Dekhiye gulaab [G]ki vo daaliyaan,
[C]badkhe chuum le na aapke kadam (2),
[Dm]Khoye khoye bhavaren bhi hai bagh me,
